// Rink plugin — the calculator, replacing rofi-calc.
//
// No prefix: typing "1920/16+7" answers directly, exactly as rofi-calc did.
// That is the whole point of the switch — rofi-calc cannot evaluate inside
// rofi's combi mode (upstream issue #33, open since 2019), which is what made
// the previous calculator entry necessary and awkward.
//
// pull_currencies enables unit and currency conversion ("20 usd in eur",
// "5 km to miles"), which rink supports natively. It fetches a currency table
// from rinkcalc.app; set it to false if the machine should not make that
// request — conversions then still work for units, just not exchange rates.
Config(
    prefix: "",
    pull_currencies: true,
)
